5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We need to assess the reliability of our current infrastructure before proposing new services.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I am worried about how new commitments will affect access for residents in remote areas.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,The budget structure often looks fine initially but fails later; we must check the funding shape.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,We should review past records to see if similar ideas have already been tried and failed.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I am concerned about whether our staff have the necessary skills for any new program.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@George, do you think the current grant terms are sustainable for long-term projects?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@May, which specific past programs do you think we should look into?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,I will look into the county grant terms and the endowment to understand the funding limits.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,I want to check the attendance sheets from former outreach stops to see what worked.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I will check the volunteer register and supervision training to see who is available.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I need to know about winter road closures to plan for potential access issues.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I will look into bus links in the two outer wards to understand current transport gaps.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I also want to see the running and equipment lines from last year to check for overruns.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I will also look into the two programmes begun six years ago to compare outcomes.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will also check the neighbourhood associations and tool certification to see local capacity.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
