35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The delivery windows for scanning equipment are unreliable, but tooling ships quickly.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"The outer wards lost bus links, making access to staffed counters very difficult.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,"The vehicle running costs overran significantly, but the equipment budget was under.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"The old digitisation project failed, but the partner-run evening groups are still successful.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"We have retired tradespeople volunteering, but no staff are trained to supervise them.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@George, does the equipment overrun mean we can't afford new tools?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@May, if the evening groups work, why did the digitisation fail?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,"The vehicle costs are the problem, not the tools. We need to be careful with mobile options.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"The digitisation failed due to lack of indexing, not the idea itself. The groups succeeded because of community ownership.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Ryuji, if tools ship fast, maybe a workshop is feasible if we solve the supervision issue.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,The winter closures are a risk for any vehicle-based service in the north.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"The remote catalogue use peaks after hours, suggesting a need for digital or evening access.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,The grant only covers fees for twelve months. We need a sustainable model beyond that.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,The attendance at former outreach stops was high. People want services where they are.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,The neighbourhood associations already run their own sessions. We could support them instead of creating new ones.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
